  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b74e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1322,
      "bookHadithIndex": 1,
      "text": "",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1322-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1322-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b74f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1323,
      "bookHadithIndex": 3,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that the Messenger of Allah (sallAllahu Alayhi wa sallam) said:\"Whoever asks for a position as a judge, then he left on his own. And whoever is forced onto it, Allah sends an angel down to him so that he can be correct.\" (Daif)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1323-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1323-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1323-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b750",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1324,
      "bookHadithIndex": 4,
      "text": "Anas narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"Whoever seeks to be a judge, and asks others to intercede for him with it, then he will be left on his own. And whoever is coerced into it, Allah sends an angel down to him so that he can be correct.\" (Daif)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1324-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1324-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1324-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b751",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1325,
      "bookHadithIndex": 5,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Whoever takes the responsibility of judge, or is appointed as judge between the people, then he has been slaughtered without a knife",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1325-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1325-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1325-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1325-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b752",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1326,
      "bookHadithIndex": 6,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"When the judge passes a judgement in which he strived and was correct, then he receives two rewards. And when he judges and is mistaken, then he receives one reward",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1326-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1326-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1326-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b753",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1327,
      "bookHadithIndex": 7,
      "text": "Some men who were companions of Mu'adh narrated from Mu'adh that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sent Mu'adh to Yemen, so he (ﷺ) said:\"How will you judge?\" He said: \"I will judge according to what is in Allah's Book.\" He said: \"If it is not in Allah's Book ?\" He said: \"Then with the Sunnah of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ).\" He said: \"If it is not in the Sunnah of Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)?\" He said: \"I will give in my view.\" He said: \"All praise is due to Allah, the One Who made the messenger of the Messenger of Allah suitable",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1327-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1327-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1327-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b754",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1328,
      "bookHadithIndex": 8,
      "text": "(Another chain of narrators) from some people from the inhabitants of Hims, from Mu'adh, from the Prophet (ﷺ), with similar",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1328-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b755",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1329,
      "bookHadithIndex": 9,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Indeed, the most beloved of people to Allah on the Day of Judgement, and the nearest to Him in the status is the just Imam. And the most hated of people to Allah and the furthest from Him in status is the oppressive Imam",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1329-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1329-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1329-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b756",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1330,
      "bookHadithIndex": 10,
      "text": "[Abdullah] Ibn Abi Al-Awfa narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"[Indeed] Allah is with the judge as long as he is not unjust. So when he is unjust, He leaves him and he is attended by Shaitan",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1330-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1330-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1330-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b757",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1331,
      "bookHadithIndex": 11,
      "text": "Ali narrated:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me: 'When two men come to you seeking judgement, do not judge for the first until you have heard the statement of the other. Soon you will know how to judge.'\" 'Ali said: \"I did not err since then",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1331-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1331-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1331-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1331-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b758",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1332,
      "bookHadithIndex": 12,
      "text": "Abul-Hasan narrated that 'Amr bin Murrah said to Mu'awiyah:\"I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: 'No Imam closes his door on one in need, dire straits and poverty, except that Allah closes the gates of the Heavens from his dire straits, his needs, and his poverty.' So Mu'awiyah appointed a man to look after the needs of the people",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1332-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1332-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1332-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1332-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b759",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1333,
      "bookHadithIndex": 13,
      "text": "(Another chain) from Abu Maryam the Companion of the Prophet (ﷺ), from the Prophet (ﷺ)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1333-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1334,
      "bookHadithIndex": 14,
      "text": "Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Bakrah narrated:\"My father wrote to 'Ubaidullah bin Abi Bakrah who was a judge: \"Do not pass a judgement between two people while you are angry, for indeed I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: 'The judge should not judge between two people while he is angry",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1334-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1334-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1334-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1334-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1335,
      "bookHadithIndex": 15,
      "text": "Mu'adh bin Jabal narrated:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) dispatched me to Yemen. When I had left, he sent a message after me, so I returned and he said: 'Do you know why I sent a message to you ? Do not take anything without my permission, for that will be Ghulul, and whoever commits Ghulul, he comes with what he took on the Day of Judgement. This is why I called you, so now go and do your job",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1335-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1335-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1335-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1336,
      "bookHadithIndex": 16,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) cursed the one who bribes and the one who takes a bribe for a judgement",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1336-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1336-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1336-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1336-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1337,
      "bookHadithIndex": 17,
      "text": "Abdullah bin 'Amr narrated:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) cursed the one who bribes and the one who takes a bribe",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1337-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1337-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1337-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1338,
      "bookHadithIndex": 18,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"If trotter (lacking meat) were given to me I would accept it, and if I was invited to (a meal of) it I would accept",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1338-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1338-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1338-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1338-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b75f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1339,
      "bookHadithIndex": 19,
      "text": "Umm Salamah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Indeed you come to me with your disputes, and I am only a human being, perhaps one of you is more eloquent at presenting his argument than the other. If I judge for one of you, giving him something from the rights of his brother, then it is only a piece of the Fire that I am giving him, so do not take anything from it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1339-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1339-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1339-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1339-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b760",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1340,
      "bookHadithIndex": 20,
      "text": "Alqamah bin Wa'il [bin Hujr] narrated from his father who said:\"A man from Hadramawt and a man from Kindah came to the Prophet (ﷺ). The Hadrami said: 'O Messenger of Allah! This person took some land of mine.' The Kindi said:'It is my land, It is in my possession, and he has no right to it.' So the Prophet (ﷺ) said to the Hadrami:'Do you have proof?' He said: 'No.' He said: 'Then you will have the oath.' He said: 'O Messenger of Allah! This man is a liar, it makes not difference what he takes an oath for, he is not ashamed of doing anything!' He said: 'There is nothing you deserve from him except that.' He said: So the man was left to take an oath for it, and in the meantime, the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'If he takes an oath [for your property] to wrongfully consume it, He will meet Allah while He is angry with him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1340-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1340-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1340-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1340-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b761",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1341,
      "bookHadithIndex": 21,
      "text": "Amr bin Shu'aib narrated from his father, from his grandfather, that during a Khutbah, the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"The proof is due from the claimant, and the oath is due from the one the claim is made against",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1341-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1341-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1341-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b762",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1342,
      "bookHadithIndex": 22,
      "text": "Ibn 'Abbas narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) judged that the oath is due from the one the claim is made against",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1342-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1342-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1342-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1342-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b763",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1343,
      "bookHadithIndex": 23,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) passed judgement based on an oath along with one witness.\" Rabi'ah (one of the narrators) said: \"A son of Ibn Sa'd bin 'Ubadah informed me saying: 'We found in a book of Sa'd that the Prophet (ﷺ) passed judgement based on an oath along with a witness",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1343-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1343-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1343-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b764",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1344,
      "bookHadithIndex": 24,
      "text": "Jabir narrated:\"The Prophet (ﷺ) passed judgement based on oath along with a witness",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1344-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1344-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1344-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b765",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1345,
      "bookHadithIndex": 25,
      "text": "Ja'far bin Muhammad narrated from his father:\"The Prophet (ﷺ) passed judgement based on an oath along with one witness.\" He said: \"And 'Ali judged between you based on it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1345-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1345-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b766",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1346,
      "bookHadithIndex": 26,
      "text": "Ibn 'Umar narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"Whoever frees a portion\" or, he said: \"a part\" or he said: \"a share he owns of a slave, then he can afford the remainder of the price according to the reasonable price, then he will be free. Otherwise he has freed as much as he has freed (only).\" Ayyub (one of the narrators) said: \"Perhaps Nafi said in this Hadith: 'Meaning he has freed as much of him as he has freed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1346-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1346-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1346-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1346-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b767",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1347,
      "bookHadithIndex": 27,
      "text": "Salim narrated from his father that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"Whoever frees a portion of a slave he owns, then he can afford the remainder of the price, then he should free him with his wealth",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1347-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1347-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1347-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b768",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1348,
      "bookHadithIndex": 28,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Whoever frees a portion\" or he said: \"a part of a slave, then he should finish paying his price if he can afford it. If he can not afford to pay reasonable price then he should be allowed to work to earn the amount that will free him without overburdening him.\" (Another chain) similar, and he said: \"a part",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1348-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1348-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1348-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1348-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b769",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1349,
      "bookHadithIndex": 29,
      "text": "Samurah narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"The lifelong gift is permitted for its inhabitant\" or:\"is an inheritance for its inhabitant",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1349-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1349-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1349-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1350,
      "bookHadithIndex": 30,
      "text": "Jabir narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"Whichever man is given a lifelong gift for himself and his offspring, then it belongs to the one whom it was given, it does not return to the one who gave it, for he has given a gift which shall be included in the inheritance",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1350-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1350-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1350-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1350-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1351,
      "bookHadithIndex": 31,
      "text": "Jabir narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"The lifelong gift is permitted for its inhabitant, and the Ruqba is permitted for its inhabitant",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1351-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1351-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1351-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1352,
      "bookHadithIndex": 32,
      "text": "Kathir bin 'Amr bin 'Awf Al-Muzani narrated from his father, from his grandfather, that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Reconciliation is allowed among the Muslims, except for reconciliation that makes the lawful unlawful, or the unlawful lawful. And the Muslims will be held to their conditions, except the conditions that make the lawful unlawful, or the unlawful lawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1352-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1352-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1352-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1352-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1353,
      "bookHadithIndex": 33,
      "text": "Al-A`raj narrated from Abu Hurairah, saying:“I heard him saying: ‘the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: “When one of you seeks his neighbor’s permission to affix a wooden beam in his wall, then do not prevent him.\"' When Abu Hurairah narrated it, they tilted their heads, so he said: ‘Why do I see that you are averse to it? By Allah! I will continue to narrate it among you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1353-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1353-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1353-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1353-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1354,
      "bookHadithIndex": 34,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“The oath is based upon what will make your companion believe you.” [Qutaibah (one of the narrators) said: “ What will make you believed by your companion”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1354-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1354-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1354-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b76f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1355,
      "bookHadithIndex": 35,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“Make the road seven forearm lengths.”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1355-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1355-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1355-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b770",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1356,
      "bookHadithIndex": 36,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"When you disagree over the road, then make it seven forearm lengths",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1356-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1356-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1356-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1356-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b771",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1357,
      "bookHadithIndex": 37,
      "text": "Abu Maimunah narrated from Abu Hurairah who said:\"The Prophet (ﷺ) gave a boy the choice between his father and his mother",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1357-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1357-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1357-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1357-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b772",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1358,
      "bookHadithIndex": 38,
      "text": "Aishah narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:\"Indeed the most wholesome of what you consume is from your earnings, and indeed your children are from your earnings",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1358-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1358-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1358-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b773",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1359,
      "bookHadithIndex": 39,
      "text": "Anas narrated:\"One of the wives of the Prophet (ﷺ) gave the Prophet (ﷺ) some food in a bowl. Then 'Aishah broke the bowl with her hand, and discarded what was in it. So the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Food for food and vessel for vessel",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1359-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1359-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1359-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1359-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b774",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1360,
      "bookHadithIndex": 40,
      "text": "Anas narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) borrowed a bowl which broke, so he guaranteed (compensated) it for them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1360-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Very Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1360-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Very Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1360-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b775",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 15,
      "hadithIndex": 1361,
      "bookHadithIndex": 41,
      "text": "Narrated Nafi':that Ibn 'Umar said: \"I was reviewed before the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) in the army, and I was fourteen years old, but he did not accept me. Then I was reviewed before him in the army later while I was fifteen years old, and he accepted me.\" Nafi' said: \"I narrated this Hadith to 'Uman bin 'Abdul Azeez and he said: 'This is the limit that distinguishes between childhood and adulthood.' Then he wrote to give salaries to whoever reached fifteen years old.\" (Another chain) from Nafi', from Ibn 'Umar from the Prophet (ﷺ) and it is similar, but he did not mention in it that 'Umar bin 'Abdul-'Aziz wrote that this is the limit that distinguishes between youth and childhood and adulthood. In his narration, Ibn 'Uyainah said (that Nafi' said): \"I narrated it to 'Umar bin 'Abdul-'Aziz and he said: 'This is the limit that distinguishes between children and soldiers",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1361-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1361-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1361-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-15-1361-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
